{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01DX1zpSQUspvk6LRZu9wJzQ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Pascualito\"}, {\"url\": \"https://parnassusbooks.net/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://northtownbooks.com/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://uapress.arizona.edu/book/time-commences-in-xibalba\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mitpressbookstore.mit.edu/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://chaucersbooks.com/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://biblat.unam.mx/en/revista/liminar-estudios-sociales-y-humanisticos/articulo/el-divino-mestizo-frente-a-la-maquina-de-guerra-mimesis-heterogenea-y-subjetividad-migrante-en-el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba-de-luis-de-lion\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/28923565\"}, {\"url\": \"https://trehlus21.corpeeu.org/node/6210\"}, {\"url\": \"https://exhibits.lib.unc.edu/exhibits/show/maya/modern/el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:40:46.487Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Luis de Lión novela \"San Pascualito\"", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01ALu4DAAvqiwRDNxk3RmGfw", "content": [{"title": "San Pascualito", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Pascualito"}, {"title": "parnassusbooks.net", "url": "https://parnassusbooks.net/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "northtownbooks.com", "url": "https://northtownbooks.com/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "Time Commences in Xibalbá", "url": "https://uapress.arizona.edu/book/time-commences-in-xibalba"}, {"title": "Time Commences in Xibalbá (Sun Tracks )", "url": "https://mitpressbookstore.mit.edu/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "Time Commences in Xibalbá (Sun Tracks )", "url": "https://chaucersbooks.com/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "Journal: | Liminar estudios sociales y humanísticos |", "url": "https://biblat.unam.mx/en/revista/liminar-estudios-sociales-y-humanisticos/articulo/el-divino-mestizo-frente-a-la-maquina-de-guerra-mimesis-heterogenea-y-subjetividad-migrante-en-el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba-de-luis-de-lion"}, {"title": "Jump to ratings and reviews", "url": "https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/28923565"}, {"title": "trehlus21.corpeeu.org", "url": "https://trehlus21.corpeeu.org/node/6210"}, {"title": "el tiempo principia en xibalba", "url": "https://exhibits.lib.unc.edu/exhibits/show/maya/modern/el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba"}]}, "Luis de Lión's novel *El tiempo principia en Xibalbá* does feature San Pascualito, though the link is through a character.\n\n- **The saint in the novel:** Wikipedia says the folk saint is represented by a character named Pascal in the novel El tiempo principia en Xibalbá (\"Time Commences in Xibalbá\") by Guatemalan author Luis de Lión (José Luis de León Díaz).\n- **The novel:** Its plot centers on a prodigal son, Pascual, who returns to his Guatemalan village after military service. He is changed, both scarred and \"enlightened\" by his experiences.\n- **Publication:** The book won a prize in 1972 but appeared only after the author's death. It won the Central American novel prize at the Juegos Florales at Quetzaltenango in 1972. It was not published, however, until 1985, after Lión's death.\n- **The author:** Lión was seized in Guatemala City on May 15, 1984, by a group of armed plainclothes men, and he is presumed to have been killed weeks later. He is listed among the people disappeared during the Guatemalan Civil War.\n- **English edition:** The novel is available in English as *Time Commences in Xibalbá*, translated by Nathan C. Henne, with an afterword by Arturo Arias."], "durationSeconds": 4.538102000000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01DX1zpSQUspvk6LRZu9wJzQ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgETAodLc9VDFDCsU1Hjy", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：***El tiempo principia en Xibalbá*（英译本 *Time Commences in Xibalbá*）。\n\nJosé Luis de León Díaz 的笔名是 Luis de Lión。按英文维基百科的说法，民间圣徒 San Pascualito 在这部小说里由主角 Pascual 来体现，书中他在军队服役后回到自己的村子。所以严格地说，小说的主角是 Pascual，San Pascualito 是这个人物所代表的形象。这部小说 1972 年获克萨尔特南戈 Juegos Florales 中美洲小说奖，1985 年作者遇害后才出版。\n\n共搜了 2 次。\n\n依据网址：\n- [San Pascualito – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Pascualito)\n- [Time Commences in Xibalbá – University of Arizona Press](https://uapress.arizona.edu/book/time-commences-in-xibalba)\n- [El tiempo principia en Xibalbá – UNC Libraries 展览页](https://exhibits.lib.unc.edu/exhibits/show/maya/modern/el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1415, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5471, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1415}, "output_tokens": 404, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:40:51.484Z", "request_id": "req_011CgETAoPCoU97zf3seC9Dc"}
